{% set ra = risk_audit %}
{% set dq = ra.data_quality %}
{% set severe = ra.identified_risks | selectattr("severity", "equalto", "Severe") | list %}
[RISK & RED FLAG ANALYST FINDINGS — VERIFIED AGAINST THE FILING]
- Overall Risk Profile: {{ ra.overall_risk_profile }} ({{ severe | length }} Severe of {{ ra.identified_risks | length }} verified risks)
- Primary Existential Threat: {{ ra.primary_threat_risk_id or "n/a" }} — {{ ra.primary_existential_threat or "n/a" }}
- Coverage: {{ dq.coverage_mode }} ({{ dq.item1a_chunks }} Item 1A chunks, {{ "{:,}".format(dq.chars_read) }} chars read){% if ra.disclosure_changes %} | Disclosure baseline: FY{{ ra.disclosure_changes.prior_fiscal_year }}{% else %} | Disclosure baseline: not assessed{% endif %}

{% if dq.coverage_mode == "not_provided" %}
- NO RISK FACTORS DISCLOSED: the filing's Item 1A provides no risk factors (not applicable / smaller reporting company). State this plainly in every section; do not infer, invent or rate any risk.
{% elif dq.coverage_mode == "rag_fallback" %}
- ITEM 1A NOT LOCATED: risks below come from retrieval across the filing, not from a complete read of Item 1A. Say so in the Risk Summary.
{% endif %}
{% if dq.quantified_uncovered %}
- Quantified Item 1A disclosures not cited by any verified risk (mention them in the audit trail; do not invent ratings for them):
{% for text in dq.quantified_uncovered %}
  * "{{ text }}"
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if not ra.disclosure_changes %}
- NO PRIOR-YEAR BASELINE: make no year-over-year, prior-year, or "new / heightened" disclosure claims anywhere outside the Year-over-Year section.
{% endif %}
{% if dq.notes %}
- Data-quality notes:
{% for note in dq.notes %}
  * {{ note }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

VERIFIED RISK MATRIX (embed verbatim):
{{ ra.risk_matrix_markdown }}

RISK DETAIL:
{% for r in ra.identified_risks %}
{{ r.risk_id }}. {{ r.risk_title }} [{{ r.risk_category }} | Likelihood {{ r.likelihood }} | Impact {{ r.impact }} | {{ r.severity }} | vs prior year: {{ r.disclosure_change }}]
  - Disclosure: {{ r.risk_summary }}
  - Quantified exposure: {{ r.quantified_exposure or "None stated in the filing" }}
  - Filing-stated mitigation: {{ r.mitigating_factors or "None stated in the filing" }}
  - Model lines hit: {{ r.financial_transmission | join(", ") if r.financial_transmission else "n/a" }}
  - Signposts: {{ r.monitoring_signposts | join("; ") if r.monitoring_signposts else "n/a" }}
{% for e in r.evidence %}
  - Evidence [{{ e.chunk_id }} | {{ e.item }}]: "{{ e.quote }}"
{% endfor %}
{% for a in r.adjustments %}
  - Code adjustment: {{ a }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% if ra.disclosure_changes %}
{% set dc = ra.disclosure_changes %}
YEAR-OVER-YEAR DISCLOSURE CHANGES (FY{{ fiscal_year }} vs FY{{ dc.prior_fiscal_year }}): {{ dc.new_sentences }} new, {{ dc.modified_sentences }} modified, {{ dc.unchanged_sentences }} unchanged, {{ dc.removed_sentences }} removed sentences ({{ dc.change_ratio_pct }}% of current text new or modified).
New passages:
{% for p in dc.new_passages %}
  * [{{ p.chunk_id }}] {{ p.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% if dc.removed_passages %}
Removed passages:
{% for p in dc.removed_passages %}
  * {{ p.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

VERIFIED EVIDENCE TABLE (embed verbatim):
{{ ra.evidence_table_markdown }}
